:: Widgets reaction-Kylar [widget]

/* PC lines (plead / demand / forgive / moan). */

<<widget "pcLine-kylar-plead">>
	<<speechLine>>"Kylar... I thought you loved me..."<</speechLine>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pcLine-kylar-demand">>
	<<speechLine>>"I'm not in the mood for your shit right now, Kylar."<</speechLine>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "pcLine-kylar-moan">>
	<<speechLine>>"You're the only one I need, Kylar."<</speechLine>>
<</widget>>
